0000624E                           923  ; LOADS AN FILE FROM DISK TO MEMORY
0000624E                           924  ; INPUT    : A0 - DESTINATION ADDR. WITH ENOUGH SPACE AVAILABLE.
0000624E                           925  ;            A1 - POINTER TO FILE NAME
0000624E                           926  ; OUTPUT   : NONE
0000624E                           927  ; MODIFIES : NONE
0000624E                           928  ; NOTE     : THE READ DATA LOOP READS 1 BYTE AT A TIME TO ENSURE ALL FILES CAN
0000624E                           929  ;            BE LOADED. HOWEVER, IF THE FILE SIZE IS KNOWN BEFOREHAND, NO LOOP
0000624E                           930  ;            WOULD BE NECESSARY AND A SINGLE CALL TO TRAP #15 TASK 53 WOULD READ
0000624E                           931  ;            THE WHOLE FILE AS LONG AS THE FILE SIZE IS PLACED INTO D2.L.
0000624E                           932  ; NOTE     : THE ZERO-TERMINATOR (JUST BEFORE CLOSE THE FILE) IS A REQUIREMENT
0000624E                           933  ;            FOR TEXT-FILES IF THE TEXT IS TO BE PRINTED. FOR OTHER USES, IT
0000624E                           934  ;            CAN BE REMOVED.
0000624E                           935  ; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
